    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>A Mameluke soldier of noble but enslaved blood, Tel'aat el-Ali survived Tamerlane's devastating campaigns against the Mamelukes and was Embraced into the Assamites as backhanded reward for his martial prowess. Returning to Egypt amid the Anarch Revolt, he forged a fateful pact with the young @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.phgt6OMwTAoAaKfR]{Lasombra} Munther al-Aswad, personally striking the killing blow against Munther's own sire, King Sharif al-Lam'a &mdash; setting off the power struggle that still convulses Banu al-Lam'a. Rather than join the nascent @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} with Munther, Tel'aat chose to return to Alamut and the clan proper.</p><p>Tel'aat now leads a growing faction of younger Assamites who blame the elder Antara for the clan's five centuries of humiliation under the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.jaYCq9rVOh0I9NCN]{Tremere}'s blood curse (which Antara personally negotiated at the Conclave of Tyre), and he intends to unseat Antara's authority and restore the clan's old, feared reputation. He follows the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.paths-of-enlightenment.JournalEntry.nNkKkOwEHChVViI4]{Path of Power and the Inner Voice}, and grows warier by the day of his old @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} confederate Jim Spenser, an antitribu clanmate now nosing suspiciously around Banu Yashkur's territory.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Speak with the fervent, righteous certainty of a revolutionary long denied his due. The Assamites were once feared and respected; you intend, by any means necessary, to make that true again.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Emile Tobruk. Secret blood-pact of mutual silence with the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.phgt6OMwTAoAaKfR]{Lasombra} antitribu Munther al-Aswad, whose sire's death he personally caused. Rival: Antara, the Shepherd of Wolves. Growing suspicious of the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} antitribu Jim Spenser investigating Banu Yashkur's territory.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
